      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Official notification has been received, by way of the Office of the Commissioner of Investigation, that on January 10, 1972, MR. ABRAHAM BORG of 5521 Avenue K, Brooklyn, New York, refused to sign a waiver of immunity when called to testify before a grand jury in connection with the District Attorney's continuing investigation of the Municipal Loan Program.",
